ith tailscale up --login-server) if I don't let it connect with that unwanted telemetry.\n\nI have a domain that's not public. I use dns01 challenge with traefik. I simply put the ip of the domain in the /etc/hosts file. It works for everything: browsers, command line, etc.\n\nBut tailscale wants to ignore that he can already know the ip of the domain. So he decides to try to use their derp servers to get the domain ip. And the real reason? So they can get telemetry data. So they can do analytics even if I put the --no-logs-no-support flag. \n\nHelp?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/2676844935/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"davidsmith91","id":183824874,"node_id":"U_kgDOCvTx6g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/183824874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91","html_url":"https://github.com/davidsmith91","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidsmith91/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":20194465407,"node_id":"SE_lADOEFLz886bfSO0zwAAAASzrxZ_","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/20194465407","act